{"id":"658902","name":"筒骨蒸肥肠","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658902/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"筒骨","amount":"500g"},{"name":"肥肠","amount":"500g"},{"name":"金针菇干","amount":"50g"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜末","amount":"10g"},{"name":"蒜末","amount":"15g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"筒骨用盐和淀粉抓洗干净。","img":"images/658902/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入盐和料酒腌制一天，腌制好的筒骨颜色已变深","img":"images/658902/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"碗中放入蒜末和姜末，呛入热油。","img":"images/658902/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入酱油、蚝油、胡椒粉、淀粉拌匀。","img":"images/658902/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"料汁倒入筒骨内。","img":"images/658902/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"继续腌制入味。","img":"images/658902/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"已经处理好的肥肠。","img":"images/658902/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"大肠凉水入锅，加入姜和料酒焯水五分钟。","img":"images/658902/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"捞出备用。","img":"images/658902/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"清水泡发好的金针菇。","img":"images/658902/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"挤干水分后放入盘底，放点菌菇可以吸去油脂，而且增加食材的香味。","img":"images/658902/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"表面铺上肥肠。","img":"images/658902/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"再放入筒骨。","img":"images/658902/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放入电压力锅，用“蹄筋键”隔水炖煮至时间结束。","img":"images/658902/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"时间到，出锅。","img":"images/658902/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658902/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}